OL,3,GNEWSAFridge Raiders workers have 'no
OL,4,Achoice' but to strike over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood factory workers on strike over pay
OL,7,Fhave said the industrial action could
OL,8,Fimpact the supply of some leading UK
OL,9,Fbrands, including Fridge Raiders and
OL,10,FRichmond sausages.
OL,12,FWorkers at the Pilgrim's Europe food
OL,13,Fproduction plant in Enniskillen, County
OL,14,FFermanagh, want fairer pay and for
OL,15,Fstaff to be paid equally for breaks.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for Pilgrim's Europe
OL,18,Fsaid there were no product shortages
OL,19,Fand that the company had "already made
OL,20,Fa number of above-inflation pay offers"
OL,21,Fwhich had been rejected by Unite.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
