OL,3,GNEWSAFridge Raiders workers have 'no
OL,4,Achoice' but to strike over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FNoreen Daly, the Unite representative
OL,7,Ffor the factory workers, said the
OL,8,Faction would be an "all out long-term
OL,9,Fstrike".
